cadeV2.getProductListsByCriterias(merchantStore, language, searchCriterias);\nsm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/product/ProductApi.java:278:\t\t\treturn productFacade.getProductListsByCriterias(merchantStore, language, criteria);\nsm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/product/ProductApi.java:374:\t\tReadableProduct product = productFacade.getProductBySeUrl(merchantStore, friendlyUrl, language);\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
