{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"agent_message","text":"The defect is concentrated in two mapper inversions: both write `visible` into the availability column, and both read availability as visibility. The persistence model also lacks a product visibility column, so I’m adding that field and applying visibility only to shopper-facing lookups/lists while leaving merchant queries unfiltered."}}
